---
import BaseLayout from "@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for AI Career Guide.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 24, 2026</p>
    <p>AI Career Guide is a content-focused website for learning AI, building projects, and navigating technical careers. This policy describes the data practices currently used by the site.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><ul><li>No contact-form submissions are stored by this site.</li><li>Your theme preference may be stored locally in your browser using <code>localStorage</code>.</li><li>Google Analytics may process website usage data according to Google's policies.</li></ul>
    <h2>External services</h2><p>The site links to third-party tools, resources, and websites. Those services have their own privacy policies and data practices.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>The site's theme preference is stored locally in your browser. Third-party analytics may use cookies or similar technologies according to the provider's policies.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated when data practices change. The effective date will be updated after material changes.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for privacy questions or correction requests.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
